{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>西貢發生爆竊案。昨日（10日）晚上8時許，警方接獲一名62歲陳姓女子報案，其位於北港坳路的住所房間內有財物不翼而飛，懷疑上址遭到爆竊。</p><p>警員接報到場，經初步點算，相信上址有兩隻共值約20萬元的手錶及一對值約4.5萬元的耳環不知所終。經初步調查，案件列爆竊，交由黃大仙警區刑事調查隊第四隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>據了解，案中手錶是勞力士和Gerald Charles。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1196997510988566528591076.jpeg/k7HcRjSG5UIwrH89IzFdYS4NQhkqwBx0WEL0I2JC9CM\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T17:44:49.840682+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T17:36:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T20:00:04.371158+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T17:38:20.575456+00:00","content_hash":"64cdde479ea1b6b1c0a82f437e7f6fac9c9919da660b5cd40ed88b6305475ea6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}